Act as a Senior Principal Product Designer & Lead Frontend Engineer. Refactor and upgrade this e-commerce web application from scratch into a high-end, clean, ultra-modern LIGHT MODE UI (similar to Apple/Minimalist Luxury Tech). Completely discard the dark theme.

### Design System & Theme Directives
- **Background**: Soft off-white / light slate (`#FAFAFA` / `bg-slate-50`).
- **Cards & Surfaces**: Pure crisp white (`#FFFFFF`) with ultra-subtle borders (`border-slate-200/80`), rounded-2xl geometry, and smooth hover elevation shadows (`hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300`).
- **Typography**: High-contrast dark typography (`text-slate-900`), muted slate secondary text (`text-slate-500`), clean sans-serif layout.
- **Accents**: Neon Lime / Electric Emerald highlights (`#10B981` or `#D4FF00` accent badges) and deep slate call-to-action buttons (`bg-slate-900 text-white hover:bg-slate-800`).

